<title>USA: Bergenfield, N.J., sets Feb 11 for bond referendum.</title>
<headline>Bergenfield, N.J., sets Feb 11 for bond referendum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bergenfield, N.J., Board of Education voted to place a $2.57 million bond question before voters in a Feb 11 referendum, the district's business administrator said.</p>
<p>If the bond authorization is approved by voters, proceeds would be used for school repairs, including roofing and electrical work.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
